{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["This is the torah of the burnt-offering — all the sacrifices mentioned in the section of ויקרא, he goes back and completes all their laws." "It is the burnt-offering — that is offered up by day, as written: ״ביום זבחכם״ — on the day they offer their sacrifice." "All the night — its offering-up is completed." "And the fire of the altar shall burn on it — by night just as by day."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:48:22.094158977Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}